      "review_summary": "The branch changes repository-size validation to inspect staged Git index blobs, expands shell regression coverage and docs, adds a changelog note, and raises macOS CI test timeouts.\n\nReproducibility: yes. from source inspection: current main checks mutable working-tree paths from `git ls-files -z`, so a staged oversized blob can be missed after the working-tree file changes or disappears. I did not run the shell tests because this review must keep the checkout read-only.",
